  ozelFonksiyon: 
  aciklama:
  - "Fincan \xE7eperlerinde yatay konumda beliren bir \"t\u0131rpan\" adeta telvelerini
    \u015Fekillendirmi\u015F {{isim}}. Bu t\u0131rpan\u0131n de\u011Fdi\u011Fi her
    telve nizami \xF6l\xE7\xFClerde yans\u0131m\u0131\u015F fal\u0131na. \U0001F9D0Anlad\u0131\u011F\u0131m
    kadar\u0131yla, yakla\u015F\u0131k {{sayi,3,5}} haftad\u0131r kabu\u011Funa \xE7ekilmi\u015Fsin
    ve bir nevi hayat\u0131n\u0131 restore etmenin yollar\u0131 \xFCzerine d\xFC\u015F\xFCnmeye
    koyulmu\u015Fsun. Bu ba\u011Flamda kendini geli\u015Ftirmenin temellerini att\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Hayat\u0131nda fazlal\u0131k olan gereksiz insanlar\u0131 ve
    d\xFC\u015F\xFCnceleri k\xF6k\xFCnden \xE7ekip atabilmi\u015Fsin. Yine de budanmay\u0131
    bekleyen baz\u0131 telveler, b\u0131rakamad\u0131\u011F\u0131n k\xF6t\xFC al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n
    varl\u0131\u011F\u0131na i\u015Faret ediyor. Bu al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n
    neden oldu\u011Fu kay\u0131plar\u0131n \xF6n\xFCn\xFC kesmeyi ba\u015Fard\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    takdirde, \"temellerini att\u0131\u011F\u0131n\" hayat \xE7izgisi \xFCzerinde
    daha emin ad\u0131mlarla y\xFCr\xFCyebileceksin."
